msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model,name:product_trace_expiry.model_product_trace
msgid "Lot/Serial Number"
msgstr "Šarže / Seriové číslo"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__expiration_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__expiration_time
msgid ""
"Number of days after the receipt of the products (from the vendor or in "
"stock after production) after which the goods may become dangerous and must "
"not be consumed. It will be computed on the lot/serial number."
msgstr ""
"Počet dní po přijetí produktů (od prodejce nebo na skladě po výrobě), po "
"kterých se zboží může stát nebezpečným a nesmí být spotřebováno. Bude "
"vypočítáno na šarži / sériovém čísle."

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__alert_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__alert_time
msgid ""
"Number of days before the Expiration Date after which an alert should be "
"raised on the lot/serial number. It will be computed on the lot/serial "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Počet dní před datem vypršení platnosti, po kterém by mělo být upozorněno na"
" šarži / sériové číslo. Bude vypočítáno na šarži / sériovém čísle."

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__removal_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__removal_time
msgid ""
"Number of days before the Expiration Date after which the goods should be "
"removed from the stock and not be counted in the Fresh On Hand Stock "
"anymore.It will be computed on the lot/serial number."
msgstr ""

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_product__use_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_trace_expiry.field_product_template__use_time
msgid ""
"Number of days before the Expiration Date after which the goods starts "
"deteriorating, without being dangerous yet. It will be computed on the "
"lot/serial number."
msgstr ""
"Počet dní před datem vypršení platnosti, po kterém se zboží začne zhoršovat,"
" aniž by to ještě bylo nebezpečné. Bude vypočítáno na šarži / sériovém "
"čísle."

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model,name:product_trace_expiry.model_product_template
msgid "Product"
msgstr "Produkt"

#. module: product_trace_expiry
#: model:ir.model,name:product_trace_expiry.model_product_category
